  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: 186 – 82 + (129 ÷ 3) – 6 × 8 + (31 – 19) × 2 = 85\n\n**Option 1) 186 and 129**\n\nTwo number need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 129 – 82 + (__**186 ÷ 3**__) – 6 × 8 + (__**31 – 19**__) × 2 = 85\n\n⇒ 129 – 82 + 62 – __**6 × 8**__ + __**12 × 2**__ = 85\n\n⇒ 129 – 82 + 62 – 48 + 24 = 85\n\n⇒ **215**** - 130** = 85\n\n⇒ **85 ****= 85**\n\nOption 2) 8 and 19\n\nTwo numbers need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 186 – 82 + (__**129 ÷ 3)**__ – 6 × 19 + __**(31 – 8**__) × 2 = 85\n\n⇒ 186 – 82 + 43 – __**6 × 19**__ + __**23 × 2**__ = 85\n\n⇒ 186 – 82 + 43 – 114 + 46 = 85\n\n⇒ __**275 - 196**__ = 85\n\n​⇒ 76 ≠ 85\n\nOption 3) 2 and 6\n\n \nTwo numbers need to be interchanged then:\n\n \n\n⇒ 186 – 82 + (1__**29 ÷ 3**__) – 2 × 8 + (**__31 – 19__**) × 6 = 85\n\n⇒ 186 – 82 + 43 – __**2 × 8**__ + __**12 × 6**__ = 85\n\n⇒__** 186**__ – __**82 + 43**__ –__**16 + 72**__ = 85\n\n⇒ 301 - 98 = 85\n\n⇒ 203 ≠ 85\n\nOption 4) 82 and 31\n\nTwo numbers need to be interchanged then:\n\n \n\n⇒ 186 – 31 + (__**129 ÷ 3)**__ – 6 × 8 + (__**82 – 19**__) × 2 = 85\n\n⇒ 186 – 31 + 43 – __**6 × 8**__ + __**63 × 2**__ = 85\n\n⇒ __**186**__ – __31 + 43__ – __**48 + 126 **__= 85\n\n⇒ __**355 - 79**__ = 85\n\n⇒ 276 ≠ 85\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"186 and 129\".",
